OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer praises 'fantastic'
OL,4,Aelection turnout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe returning officer of Sark said he
OL,7,Fwas "thrilled" with the electoral
OL,8,Fturnout at the island's election.
OL,10,FThe election recorded the highest voter
OL,11,Fturnout in 20 years, with a 73.67%
OL,12,Fvoter turnout.
OL,14,FSix sitting members return to Sark's
OL,15,FChief Pleas - members Helen Plummer,
OL,16,FPatrick Dewe, Nick Moloney, John
OL,17,FGuille, Karl Rang and Joseph Perree
OL,18,Fwere among the successful candidates.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
