OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer praises 'fantastic'
OL,4,Aelection turnout
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Armorgie said it was "a fantastic
OL,7,Fendorsement of the proactive
OL,8,Finvolvement with politics - if there
OL,9,Fwas ever any doubt that Sark was not
OL,10,Finterested in and committed to
OL,11,Fpolitics, then I think the result is
OL,12,Factually living proof of that."
